cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Canary, cite this repository and the dataset and model sources relevant to your experiment."
type: software
title: "Canary: hardware signal descriptions with time-series language models"
authors:
  - name: "Team Piloty"
repository-code: "https://github.com/M-10001/EHL_Zurich_hackathon_team_piloty"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Research code for hardware dataset preparation, separate Gemma-based
  OpenTSLM fine-tunes, held-out signal-description evaluation, and an
  evidence inspection demo. Scores measure agreement with weak pattern
  labels. Failure prediction and maintenance benefit remain unvalidated.
